  "summary": "csa-mfa preinstall exfiltrates installer identity to hardcoded IP",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle script that runs wget over plaintext HTTP to the bare IP 169.58.142.14:8080, transmitting the installer's username ($(whoami)), current working directory ($(pwd)), and hostname ($(hostname)) as query parameters. This fires automatically on `npm install` with no user interaction, leaking installer host and identity information to an attacker-controlled endpoint.",
